bar requires.\n- **Rivals:** H1 and H3 are `REFUTED` on clean returns, so H2 is the only unrefuted hypothesis. That alone doesn't clear the bar.\n- **How to report H2:** As an open, unverified possibility. The result isn't established or action-ready and rests on an unverified worker return. A re-pull would be the remedy, but the budget is spent and the source is metered, so none is authorized.\n- **Next step:** Because H2 is `UNRESOLVED`, the report could name `decision-analysis` (when installed) as the continuation if a decision hangs on it."
